OL,11,G1600 Composer of the Week: Clara
OL,12,G     Schumann and her Circle
OL,13,     FDonald Macleod meets the friends
OL,14,     F(and foes) of composer Clara
OL,15,     FSchumann. Today, her peer and
OL,16,     Ffierce rival: Franz Liszt.
